tags: studio
studioTitle: "Menu — tri-fold"
studioCategory: "Menus"
studioSize: "11 × 8.5 in landscape · duplex, 2 pages · letter-fold"
studioNote: "Print duplex, flip on SHORT edge, then letter-fold: right third in first, left third over it. Sheet 1 left-to-right is tuck flap / back cover / front cover; the cover doubles as a flyer (hours, address, phone, both links). Breakfast lives on the tuck flap, so it is what a customer reads the instant the cover lifts; the inside sheet is lunch. Re-check src/_data/menu.json's handwriting note before a real print run."
